# R9 — the decisive non-cyclic task: a^3 + ab mod 97 (Power et al.). No circle solution
# exists, so this asks whether H1 tracks generalisation beyond circle-shaped structure.
# Step budget raised to 60k on 2026-08-24: the measured grokking step for this
# recipe is 25.7k-34.7k, so a 40k budget leaves no post-transition plateau.
+experiment=tf_mod97_grok data=mod_poly_p97 seed=0 train.capture_representations=false train.n_snapshots=150 train.steps=60000
+experiment=tf_mod97_grok data=mod_poly_p97 seed=1 train.capture_representations=false train.n_snapshots=150 train.steps=60000
+experiment=tf_mod97_grok data=mod_poly_p97 seed=2 train.capture_representations=false train.n_snapshots=150 train.steps=60000
+experiment=tf_mod97_grok data=mod_poly_p97 seed=3 train.capture_representations=false train.n_snapshots=150 train.steps=60000
+experiment=tf_mod97_grok data=mod_poly_p97 seed=4 train.capture_representations=false train.n_snapshots=150 train.steps=60000
